          <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: hsl(var(--foreground));">
            Based on SnusFriend' testing of over 50 beginner-friendly products, the best nicotine pouches for beginners are ZYN Mini (1.5–3 mg), VELO Easy Mint (4 mg), and HELWIT (3.5 mg). Start with 2–4 mg strength, choose a mild flavour like mint or citrus, and use 3–4 pouches per day spaced at least 2 hours apart. If you feel dizzy or nauseous, your strength is too high — step down.
          </p>
        </div>

        <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">What strength pouch for a beginner?</summary>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Beginners should start with 2–3mg nicotine pouches (sometimes labelled "Light"), such as <a href="/brands/zyn" style="color: hsl(var(--primary));">ZYN 3mg</a> or entry-level VELO options. This allows the body to adjust without overwhelming nicotine effects or nausea.</p>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">How many pouches a day is normal?</summary>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px;">New users typically use 2–4 pouches daily, while regular users average 6–10; some heavy users consume 15+ pouches per day depending on strength and lifestyle. Find your personal equilibrium based on nicotine cravings and tolerance.</p>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 16px; background: hsl(var(--muted)); border-radius: 8px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">What's the mildest nicotine pouch?</summary>
